      "details": [
        {
          "icon": "router",
          "label": "",
          "value": "We do offer a mid-stay cleaning service! The service includes a full cleaning, including bed linens and towels being washed. This service must be confirmed and paid at least 24 hours in advance.   If you would like to add it, please also let us know the day, time and whether you intend to be at the house on the day of the cleaning.",
